### S3 — Agent poll pending tasks (getXPPOllData)

# @name pendingTasks

GET {{Intellinode.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agents/tasks/pending

Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}



# Expected: 200 { "tasks": [ { "id", "legacyTaskId", "moduleName", "functionName", "signal": "&CD", "status": "InProcess" } ] }



### S3 — Agent acknowledge task (getXPAckNEW) — batch body

POST {{Intellinode.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agents/tasks/ack

Content-Type: application/json

Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}



{

  "acknowledgements": [

    {

      "taskId": "{{queuedTaskId}}",

      "legacyTaskId": {{queuedLegacyTaskId}},

      "status": "Completed",

      "ackCode": "SHACK"

    }

  ]

}



# Expected: 204 No Content



