### S4 — Refresh with old refresh token after rotation → 401 RefreshTokenRevoked

POST {{Intellinode.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agents/auth/refresh

Content-Type: application/json



{

  "refreshToken": "{{oldRefreshToken}}"

}



# Expected: 401 { "error": "RefreshTokenRevoked", ... }



### S4 — Refresh with garbage token → 401 InvalidRefreshToken

POST {{Intellinode.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agents/auth/refresh

Content-Type: application/json



{

  "refreshToken": "not-a-valid-refresh-token"

}



# Expected: 401 { "error": "InvalidRefreshToken", ... }



### S4 — Revoke refresh token → 204

POST {{Intellinode.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agents/auth/revoke

Content-Type: application/json



{

  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"

}



# Expected: 204 No Content



### S4 — Refresh after revoke → 401 RefreshTokenRevoked

POST {{Intellinode.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agents/auth/refresh

Content-Type: application/json



{

  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"

}



# Expected: 401 { "error": "RefreshTokenRevoked", ... }

